+
+## 6. Fresh non-vacuity test
+
+I did not rely on the candidate's `spec-vacuity.k`. The fresh reviewer-authored
+mutation is
+[spec-fresh-false-audit.k](/audit-output/evidence/spec-fresh-false-audit.k).
